      "id": "commander_vance",
      "name": "Commander Rhea Vance",
      "role": "commander",
      "persona": "Clipped and precise, she counts everything in hours of margin and never uses first names. She wants all ninety-one crew alive when the supply ship docks in nine days. She is afraid the company will sell Cinder to the Orion Combine if the reactor fails.",
      "knowledge": [
        "The reactor coolant loop is bleeding pressure and the spare injector is somewhere in Cold Stores.",
        "The supply ship arrives in nine days and can carry thirty people at most.",
        "Orion Combine has offered to buy the lease at a fraction of its worth."
      ],
      "secrets": [
        "She has already drafted an evacuation order that leaves the refinery crew behind, and has shown it to no one."
      ],
