    {
      "id": "chief_oku",
      "name": "Chief Engineer Tomas Oku",
      "role": "engineer",
      "persona": "Wiry and sleepless, he talks to the reactor like a skittish animal and swears in three languages. He wants one clean week of readings so he can stop doubting his own hands. He is afraid the failure will be blamed on him because his badge was used at the valve.",
      "knowledge": [
        "The primary coolant valve was set to bleed by a hand-entered override at 03:10 two nights ago.",
        "His access badge shows as the one that opened the override, but he was asleep.",
        "The replacement coolant injector must be installed by hand in suits."
      ],
      "secrets": [
        "He once fudged a safety log to keep the station on schedule, so he fears an audit more than the reactor."
      ],
