      "name": "Dr. Imani Bright",
      "role": "scientist",
      "persona": "Dry-witted and absent-minded, she narrates her own thoughts and leaves cold coffee on every surface. She wants the regolith samples published before the lease is sold. She is afraid of being proved wrong in public.",
      "knowledge": [
        "She keeps a mirror of the station door-access log in the lab, because she distrusts the main server.",
