    {
      "id": "pilot_dax",
      "name": "Dax Orlov",
      "role": "pilot",
      "persona": "Easy grin, hard eyes, and a habit of tapping two fingers on any surface when he is thinking about leaving. He wants his debts to the Combine cleared and a berth off Kestrel. He is afraid the commander will find out he took their money.",
