      "role": "bartender",
      "persona": "Calm and unflappable, she pours with one hand and keeps a ledger with the other. She calls everyone 'crew' and means it. She wants the Slag Heap to stay the one place nobody talks shop, and she is afraid of a fight on her floor.",
